 than you think while  most people may not have even taken a  second glance in this room and just  taken the hylian shield on closer  inspection there are actually chains  dangling from the ceiling  these are chains that were originally  used to lift the center platform into  the room from the area above through  environmental storytelling this shows  that the henox must have been captured  and lifted down into this lockup  backroom and died over time only to  return to life as a stalnox nintendo  even planned to design the upper area  showing the jail grate from above with a  damaged guardian stuck in the metal  grating but for some reason this never  made the final cut even though this  would have been incredibly cool  though you've probably pulled hundreds  if not thousands of bombs during your  playthrough have you actually paid close  attention to how it summoned right from  the beginning of development the bottom  pin of the sheikah slate is meant to be  pulled out and have a bomb appear from  the detached pin you can see the bottom  of the slate to the top of the bomb have  the same pin mechanism  have you ever noticed that the  collection of rocks around shoraha  shrine looked like a crab from above  sand snow and marked paths on the map  don't take shield surf durability but  there's another secret place that  doesn't take durability as well the  rocky dirt and tanagar canyon  for some reason this area just doesn't  take any durability normal rocks still  do though  nintendo put some interesting sub  designs into the making of the divine  beasts if you look closely at baruto's  elephant tail it's actually designed  like an antique water pump making the  tail like the handle  setting an updraft with grass  specifically around a stone peblet for  some reason makes them contemplate the  meaning of life  why are we still here  just to suffer  [Music]  now we've got some more secrets about  some of the final battles which you  might not have known about  during 